Intel(R) Itanium(R) Architecture Software Developer's Manual
Specification Update, June 2008 is available for public download at

http://download.intel.com/design/itanium/specupdt/248699.pdf

Specification Changes include:
+ New data speculation disable capability to make code execution
  more reproducible
+ Architecture Interruption Instruction Bundle Registers for
  virtualization optimization
+ Data poisoning Promotion Changes
+ ACPI P-State Clarifications, including variable frequency
  mode description
+ New Synchronization Requirements for Virtualization Opcode
  Optimization

